Error [jet.CalledNonFunction]: `input` is Iter<String>, not a function
  --> tests/ui/ambient_input_call_e0803.jet:2:8
    |
  2 |     _: input("name? ")
    |        ^^^^^
 Why: `input` is every line of the program's input (the files its arguments name, else standard input), read lazily by a `loop` or an Iter method
 Fix: Read one line with a prompt through `readline(prompt)` from core.term (`use core.term.[readline]`), or loop over `input`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0803
